IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ITEMSUM.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ITEM-INDEX PIC 9(2) COMP.
01 WS-ITEM-INPUT PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-ITEM-PREMIUM PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-ITEM-TABLE.
   05 WS-ITEM-ENTRY OCCURS 6 TIMES.
      10 WS-ITEM-STATUS PIC X.
      10 WS-ITEM-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY REQAREA.
COPY CALCAREA.
COPY ERRAREA.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING REQUEST-AREA CALC-AREA ERROR-AREA.
SUM-ACTIVE-ITEMS.
    MOVE ZERO TO CALC-ITEM-TOTAL.
    PERFORM LOAD-LOCAL-ITEMS.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-ITEM-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-ITEM-INDEX > INPUT-ITEM-COUNT
           OR PROCESS-STATUS NOT = ZERO
        IF WS-ITEM-STATUS(WS-ITEM-INDEX) = 'A'
            MOVE WS-ITEM-AMOUNT(WS-ITEM-INDEX) TO WS-ITEM-INPUT
            CALL 'ITEMCALC' USING BY CONTENT WS-ITEM-INPUT
                BY REFERENCE WS-ITEM-PREMIUM ERROR-AREA
                ON EXCEPTION
                    MOVE 91 TO PROCESS-STATUS
                    MOVE 'ITEM-CALL' TO ERROR-STAGE
                    MOVE 'PROGRAM-UNAVAILABLE' TO ERROR-CODE
            END-CALL
            IF PROCESS-STATUS = ZERO
                ADD WS-ITEM-PREMIUM TO CALC-ITEM-TOTAL
                    ON SIZE ERROR
                        MOVE 43 TO PROCESS-STATUS
                        MOVE 'ITEM-TOTAL' TO ERROR-STAGE
                        MOVE 'ITEM-TOTAL-OVERFLOW' TO ERROR-CODE
                END-ADD
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.
    GOBACK.
LOAD-LOCAL-ITEMS.
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-1-STATUS TO WS-ITEM-STATUS(1).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-1-AMOUNT TO WS-ITEM-AMOUNT(1).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-2-STATUS TO WS-ITEM-STATUS(2).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-2-AMOUNT TO WS-ITEM-AMOUNT(2).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-3-STATUS TO WS-ITEM-STATUS(3).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-3-AMOUNT TO WS-ITEM-AMOUNT(3).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-4-STATUS TO WS-ITEM-STATUS(4).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-4-AMOUNT TO WS-ITEM-AMOUNT(4).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-5-STATUS TO WS-ITEM-STATUS(5).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-5-AMOUNT TO WS-ITEM-AMOUNT(5).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-6-STATUS TO WS-ITEM-STATUS(6).
    MOVE INPUT-ITEM-6-AMOUNT TO WS-ITEM-AMOUNT(6).
    EXIT.
